<title>SRI LANKA: Aitken Spence 6-month net turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Aitken Spence 6-month net turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Aitken Spence &amp; Co Ltd for the six months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				 6 months 1996	     6 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		    1,241.62     vs	   1,286.50</p>
<p>    Net profit/(loss)	   (18.21)    vs		26.85</p>
<p>    Tax provision		  10.98     vs		13.64</p>
<p>NOTE - Aitken Spence is the holding company of a group involved in tourism in Sri Lanka and the Maldives, agribusiness, garment manufacturing, and freight forwarding. Unsettled local conditions affecting the tourist industry have had a serious impact on group earnings, a company statement said.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
